#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:183
msgid ""
"In this module, you can choose whether to use Internet Keywords or not. You "
"can also configure various Internet search engines that KDE can use for "
"keyword search. This allows you, for example, to enter a pseudo-URI like "
"gg:smetana to search the Google search engine for web pages about the Czech "
"composer Bedrich Smetana."
msgstr ""
"kcmkurifilt.po"
"ໂມດູນນີ້ "
"ໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າ"
"ຈະໃຊ້ຄີເວີດອີນເຕີເນັດຫຼືບໍ່ "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງເຄື່ອງມື"
"ຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ KDE "
"ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄົ້ນຫາຄີເວິດ "
"ໄດ້ ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ"
"ຕື່ມຄືຮູບແບບ URI ເຊັ່ນ gg:smetana "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄົ້ນຫາດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື "
"ຄົ້ນຫາຂອງ Google "
"ສຳລັບເວັບເພດກ່ງວກັບ Czech "
"composer Bedrich Smetana ເປັນຕົ້ນ"

